.
.  Generate sample output for Normal PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
device 2 postscript
device 2 color on
background color blue
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
MULTIPLOT SCALE FACTOR 2
.
THICKNESS 0.2
LEGEND 1 LSL
LEGEND 2 USL
LEGEND 1 COORDINATES 18 92
LEGEND 2 COORDINATES 82 92
LEGEND 2 JUSTIFICATION RIGHT
LEGEND 3 COORDINATES 50 5
LEGEND 3 JUSTIFICATION CENTER
LEGEND 3 FONT COMPLEX
LEGEND SIZE 4
LEGEND 3 SIZE 2
LEGEND CASE ASIS
FRAME CORNER COORDINATES 15 0 85 100
X2FRAME OFF
TIC MARKS OFF
TIC MARK LABELS OFF
.
LEGEND 3 CSUB()pUNSB() = 1.00
XLIMITS -3 3
PLOT NORPDF(X) FOR X = -3 0.01 3
.
LEGEND 3 CSUB()pUNSB() = 1.33
XLIMITS -4 4
PLOT NORPDF(X) FOR X = -3 0.01 3
.
LEGEND 3 CSUB()pUNSB() = 1.66
XLIMITS -5 5
PLOT NORPDF(X) FOR X = -3 0.01 3
.
LEGEND 3 CSUB()pUNSB() = 2.00
XLIMITS -6 6
PLOT NORPDF(X) FOR X = -3 0.01 3
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
device 2 close
system cp dppl1f.dat plotcp.ps
.
quit
